  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dedb8b25-5c0d-45ef-a510-92a3fc395a69-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>&lambda;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&beta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&lambda;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&beta;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
